00:17:55,610 --> 00:17:56,610
- Another one? - Another one?

516
00:17:56,611 --> 00:17:57,710
Add syrup.

517
00:17:58,620 --> 00:18:01,750
And if you want to eat it a bit sweeter, add ice cream on top.

518
00:18:02,050 --> 00:18:03,666
- Wait, just a bit sweeter? - It's already sweet, isn't it?

519
00:18:03,690 --> 00:18:05,619
It's already super heavy.

520
00:18:05,620 --> 00:18:06,620
How many calories would that be?

521
00:18:06,621 --> 00:18:07,930
I recommend trying that combo.

522
00:18:08,230 --> 00:18:11,599
When craving real sweetness, it seems worth trying once.

523
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:13,206
- Yes, exactly. - I can't eat it frequently.

524
00:18:13,230 --> 00:18:14,230
- Right. - Honestly,

525
00:18:14,231 --> 00:18:16,029
though, it sounds so delicious.

526
00:18:16,030 --> 00:18:17,329
- It probably would be. - It'll be so sweet.

527
00:18:17,330 --> 00:18:18,339
My mouth is watering.

528
00:18:18,340 --> 00:18:19,770
(Please try it.)

529
00:18:19,870 --> 00:18:24,609
We talked about home-cooked meals from each country,

530
00:18:24,610 --> 00:18:26,739
