531
00:18:26,740 --> 00:18:28,479
- Right, even if you want to buy it, - You're right.

532
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:30,809
You can't get that exact taste anywhere.

533
00:18:30,810 --> 00:18:32,050
Yes, it doesn't taste the same.

534
00:18:32,180 --> 00:18:35,920
Jaemin is our born-and-raised Korean.

535
00:18:36,090 --> 00:18:37,350
