536
00:18:37,450 --> 00:18:38,919
For me, cheonggukjang and spicy stir-fried pork.

537
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:41,660
(That combination was introduced in episode 1 as "Jaemin's Table.")

538
00:18:41,860 --> 00:18:45,560
(His favorite comfort food)

539
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:47,599
How does your mom make it?

540
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:50,199
Her cheonggukjang has lots of vegetables.

541
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:51,240
Mostly veggies and tofu.

542
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:52,270
- With tofu? - Yes,

543
00:18:52,271 --> 00:18:53,600
