544
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:55,539
- You said you sent a photo? - Yes, I sent one.

545
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:56,540
Let's check it out.

546
00:18:56,740 --> 00:18:57,740
- I'm so curious. - Let's see.

547
00:18:57,740 --> 00:18:58,740
We can tell after we see it. That's right.

548
00:18:58,741 --> 00:19:00,909
(Jaemin's home-cooked meal revealed)

549
00:19:00,910 --> 00:19:01,910
I love this so much.

550
00:19:02,110 --> 00:19:07,179
I can tell Jaemin sent a real photo of home-cooked food...

551
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:08,919
