555
00:19:16,230 --> 00:19:18,430
And I love that linoleum flooring so much.

556
00:19:18,730 --> 00:19:19,759
- That flooring... - Right.

557
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:21,669
- and that dining table. That wood. - That floor.

558
00:19:21,670 --> 00:19:23,306
- It feels so nostalgic. - It really does.

559
00:19:23,330 --> 00:19:24,570
I want to visit.

560
00:19:26,170 --> 00:19:30,740
I heard Sanghyeon's mom makes an amazing cheonggukjang too.

561
00:19:30,810 --> 00:19:33,039
- Cheonggukjang? - I love it too.

562
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:35,050
